The '''Graveyard Island''' is a gloomy, spiky island for players between Lv. 950 to 1000. It is home to a surprisingly large range of [[NPCs]] and [[Easter Eggs|easter eggs]], despite it being such a small island.

From the docks, the player will be faced with a large spire in the center of the island surrounded by graves and [[Zombie|Zombies]]. In the sea around the island are additional spikes that protrude from the ground. As the player travels around the island, they will see a large cave with an open front that contains [[Vampire|Vampires]].

Near Graveyard Island is the [[Cursed Ship]], an island for players between Lv. 1250 to 1350, which the player is not able to enter unless they are at least Lv. 1000. However, the inside of this ship is located on the sea far away; if the player tries to go near it and reset their character, they will spawn inside without even being Lv. 1000.

