==Graveyard Door==
[[File:Graveyard Door.png|thumb]]
The Graveyard Door is used to obtain the [[Dark Blade/Slayer Skin|Slayer skin]] of [[Dark Blade]].

The only way to use the Graveyard door is to click on the button next to the door while meeting the requirements of the [[Dark Blade]]'s Slayer Skin obtainment.

When the Graveyard door opens, the following [[System Messages|system message]] will be shown to everyone in the player's server at the top of their screens:
:{{System Message|A NEW SLAYER HAS BEEN BORN...}}

===Notes===
* The Graveyard door cannot be used twice on the same server, meaning that only one player can use this door and obtain [[Dark Blade/Slayer Skin|Slayer Skin]] until the server restarts.
** The Graveyard door will appear as a white door if someone has already used it.

==Trivia==
* The [[Flowers|Blue Flower]] can be found on Graveyard Island.
* The theme of the Graveyard Island is called Deep Mist, the same as [[Haunted Shipwreck]].
* The [[Death King]], which was added in [[Updates/16|Update 16]], then removed in [[Updates/17|Update 17]], used to be found on Graveyard Island.
* Two named graves can be found on Graveyard Island: one belonging to [[Wenlocktoad]] and the other to fudd10.
* Graveyard Island is the smallest major island in the [[Second Sea]].
* Graveyard Island requires only '''50''' levels of grinding before reaching the next island, making it the quickest one to progress through in the [[Second Sea]].
* PvPing a [[Control]] user on this island can be quite difficult, primarily due to the fruit's [X] move, which allows the user to levitate the island's giant pillars and hurl them as massive [[Area of Effect|AoE]] explosions.

